# SMTP Email Configuration for Contact Form

# Gmail SMTP (recommended for small volume)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-gmail@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-password

# Alternative: Custom SMTP provider
# SMTP_HOST=your-smtp-server.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your-email@yourdomain.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-password

# Notes:
# 1. For Gmail: Use App Password, not your regular password
# 2. Enable 2FA and generate App Password in Google Account settings
# 3. Alternative: Use SendGrid, Mailgun, or other email services